        "pos": "position",
        "idx": "index",
        "el": "element",
        "Tok": "Token"
      },
      "note": "oxlint cannot detect all abbreviations generically; the no-restricted-syntax identifier guard above catches the common ones. Full enforcement is by review and was applied repo-wide in tasks T8a (CSS) and T8b (JS/JSX)."
